id: pm-github-4a03
title: Guard stale completed SDK import journals after local tracker files are reset
description: A synthetic import into a real Git worktree completes an atomic journal. Resetting the worktree to its pre-import baseline removes the imported files while ignored completed journals persist. A subsequent import can report recovered success without restoring the absent items. The gated importer now verifies durable post-write provenance and refuses any push; follow up with a minimal SDK reproduction and dependency-level recovery repair.
